+enum class VrrPlace
+{
+  //! in the mode of the menus, as without the setting: they are of the video's size, or the display
+  //! has no mode of that size, or its VRR range is not known
+  MENUS,
+  MODE, //!< in the mode of its size with VRR (ChooseForVrr(): its place)
+  NONE, //!< the display has modes of its size and none with VRR: no VRR, Kodi's exact change
+};
